# ==============================================================================
# SPIDY MULTI-PROVIDER AI VISION CONFIGURATION (.env)
# ==============================================================================
# Spidy automatically cycles through all configured free API keys in order.
# If one model experiences a 429 rate limit, 503 capacity spike, or timeout,
# Spidy seamlessly fails over to the next provider so you never get stuck!
#
# Enter any or all of your API keys below (unconfigured keys can be left blank):
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Google Gemini (15 RPM / 1M TPM Free Tier)
# Get your free key at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# 2. xAI Grok (grok-2-vision / grok-vision-beta)
# Get your key at: https://console.x.ai
GROK_API_KEY=

# 3. OpenRouter (Access to free vision models: Gemini Flash, Llama 3.2 Vision, Qwen 2.5 VL)
# Get your free key at: https://openrouter.ai/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# 4. NVIDIA NIM (Llama 3.2 11B Vision Instruct - 1,000 free credits)
# Get your free key at: https://build.nvidia.com
NVIDIA_API_KEY=

# 5. Groq Cloud (Fast Llama 3.2 / Qwen 2.5 Vision)
# Get your free key at: https://console.groq.com/keys
GROQ_API_KEY=

